.el .ds Aq '
.TH git-gpg-import 1  "git-gpg-import " 
.SH NAME
git\-gpg\-import \- Import your private key(s) into the git\-gpg key store
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit\-gpg import\fR [\fB\-\-gpg\-home\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILES\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Import your private key(s) into the git\-gpg key store
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-gpg\-home\fR \fI<GPG_HOME>\fR
Key store directory (default: $HOME/.git\-gpg)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILES\fR>
File(s) containing armoured private key blocks
